+### Source Code (repository root)
+
+```
+src/
+├── components/
+│   ├── Subscription/          # 扩展 SubscriptionManager、Add/EditSubscriptionModal
+│   ├── Template/              # 新增 TemplateEditor、YamlPreview、LinkUpdater 组件
